    "q": "<p>Dumbarton Ltd (Dumbarton) acquired 80% of Kelvin Ltd’s (Kelvin) share capital in 20X1 for a cash consideration of £117,000 when Kelvin’s retained earnings were £29,000. Dumbarton measures NCI using the fair value method and determines that the fair value of the NCI at the date of acquisition is equal to £25,000. The resultant goodwill was impaired by 50% in the year ended 30 June 20X7. You are to prepare the consolidated financial statements of the Dumbarton Group for the year ended 30 June 20X9, in accordance with IFRS® Accounting Standards. The draft statements of financial position of Dumbarton and Kelvin for the year ended 30 June 20X9 are provided next:</p><p>Statements of financial position (abbreviated)</p><p>As at 30 June 20X9</p><p>Dumbarton</p><p>Kelvin</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><caption><span class=\"source-table-heading\">£’000</span><span class=\"source-table-heading\">£’000</span></caption><tbody><tr><td>Investment in Kelvin</td><td class=\"num\">117</td><td class=\"num\">-</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Other net assets</td><td class=\"num\">120</td><td class=\"num\">125</td><td class=\"num\">237</td><td class=\"num\">125</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Equity</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Share capital</td><td class=\"num\">130</td><td class=\"num\">70</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Retained earnings</td><td class=\"num\">107</td><td class=\"num\">55</td><td class=\"num\">237</td><td class=\"num\">125</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>What accounting entry is made in the year ended 30 June 20X9 to recognise the historical impairment of Goodwill in the consolidated SOFP?</p><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">a)</span><div><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><tbody><tr><td>£'000</td><td class=\"num\">£'000</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Dr</td><td class=\"num\">Retained earnings</td><td class=\"num\">21.5</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Cr</td><td class=\"num\">Goodwill</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">21.5</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">b)</span><div><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><tbody><tr><td>£'000</td><td class=\"num\">£'000</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Dr</td><td class=\"num\">Share capital</td><td class=\"num\">21.5</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Cr</td><td class=\"num\">Goodwill</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">21.5</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">c)</span><div><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><tbody><tr><td>£'000</td><td class=\"num\">£'000</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Dr</td><td class=\"num\">Goodwill</td><td class=\"num\">43</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Dr</td><td class=\"num\">Share capital</td><td class=\"num\">70</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Dr</td><td class=\"num\">Retained earnings</td><td class=\"num\">29</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Cr</td><td class=\"num\">SOFP – non-controlling interests</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">25</td></tr><tr><td>Cr</td><td class=\"num\">Investment in Kelvin</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">117</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">d)</span><div><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><tbody><tr><td>£'000</td><td class=\"num\">£'000</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Dr</td><td class=\"num\">Goodwill</td><td class=\"num\">18</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Dr</td><td class=\"num\">Share capital</td><td class=\"num\">70</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Dr</td><td class=\"num\">Retained earnings</td><td class=\"num\">29</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Cr</td><td class=\"num\">Investment in Kelvin</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">117</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div>",
    "a": "<p class=\"answer-key\">The correct answer is a.</p><p>Recognise goodwill and non-controlling interests at the date of acquisition</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><caption><span class=\"source-table-heading\">£'000</span><span class=\"source-table-heading\">£'000</span></caption><tbody><tr><td>Investment in Kelvin</td><td class=\"num\">117</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Non-controlling interest (FV of NCI £25,000)</td><td class=\"num\">25</td><td class=\"num\">142</td></tr><tr><td>Share capital</td><td class=\"num\">70</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Retained earnings</td><td class=\"num\">29</td><td class=\"num\">99</td></tr><tr><td>Goodwill</td><td class=\"num\">43</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><caption><span class=\"source-table-heading\">£'000</span><span class=\"source-table-heading\">£'000</span></caption><tbody><tr><td>Dr</td><td class=\"num\">Goodwill</td><td class=\"num\">43</td></tr><tr><td>Dr</td><td class=\"num\">Share capital</td><td class=\"num\">70</td></tr><tr><td>Dr</td><td class=\"num\">Retained earnings</td><td class=\"num\">29</td></tr><tr><td>Cr</td><td class=\"num\">SOFP – non-controlling interests</td><td class=\"num\">25</td></tr><tr><td>Cr</td><td class=\"num\">Investment in Kelvin</td><td class=\"num\">117</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Recognise any impairment of goodwill</p><p>Historical impairment = 50% x £43,000 = £21,500, rounded to £22,000</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><caption><span class=\"source-table-heading\">£'000</span><span class=\"source-table-heading\">£'000</span></caption><tbody><tr><td>Dr</td><td class=\"num\">Retained earnings</td><td class=\"num\">22</td></tr><tr><td>Cr</td><td class=\"num\">Goodwill</td><td class=\"num\">22</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Being historical impairment of goodwill</p>",
