    "lesson": "Lesson2",
    "appendix": {
      "title": "Case information",
      "html": "<p>On 1 January 20X5, Lang Ltd (Lang) acquired 90% of Ley Ltd (Ley) for £3,005,000 in cash. As at the date of acquisition, various fair value adjustments are required:</p><p>The property, plant and equipment balance includes plant with a carrying value of £1.4m. This is measured using the IAS 16 revaluation model and the current fair value is £2.1m.</p><p>The remaining property, plant and equipment is measured using the IAS 16 historical cost model and has a carrying amount of £800,000, with a fair value of £1m.</p><p>Inventories, valued at historical cost, have a fair value of £360,000.</p><p>The loans are recorded at amortised cost, with a fair value of £760,000.</p><p>Lang will incur costs of £200,000 for restructuring Ley's operations, including staff redundancies.</p><p>Ley’s management team has an agreement entitling them to £300,000 in total if they leave within a month of the acquisition. This has not been recorded in Ley’s financial statements.</p><p>Ley’s statement of financial position is provided next:</p><p>Ley Ltd</p><p>Statement of financial position</p><p>As at 1 January 20X5</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><caption><span class=\"source-table-heading\">£’000</span><span class=\"source-table-heading\">ASSETS</span><span class=\"source-table-heading\">Non-current assets</span></caption><tbody><tr><td>Property, plant and equipment</td><td class=\"num\">2,200</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>2,200</p><p>Current assets</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Inventories</td><td class=\"num\">300</td></tr><tr><td>Trade receivables</td><td class=\"num\">140</td></tr><tr><td>Cash and cash equivalents</td><td class=\"num\">20</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>460</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Total assets</td><td class=\"num\">2,660</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>EQUITY AND LIABILITIES</p><p>Equity</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Share capital</td><td class=\"num\">200</td></tr><tr><td>Share premium</td><td class=\"num\">100</td></tr><tr><td>Revaluation surplus</td><td class=\"num\">120</td></tr><tr><td>Retained earnings</td><td class=\"num\">1,100</td></tr><tr><td>Total equity</td><td class=\"num\">1,520</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Non-current liabilities</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Loans</td><td class=\"num\">800</td></tr><tr><td>Total non-current liabilities</td><td class=\"num\">800</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Current liabilities</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Trade and other payables</td><td class=\"num\">340</td></tr><tr><td>Total current liabilities</td><td class=\"num\">340</td></tr><tr><td>Total liabilities</td><td class=\"num\">1,140</td></tr><tr><td>Total equity and liabilities</td><td class=\"num\">2,660</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p></p>"
    }
