    "q": "<p>Goulding Ltd (Goulding) acquired 75% of the ordinary share capital of Samuelson Ltd (Samuelson) for £10m several years ago. At the date of acquisition, Samuelson had share capital of £5m and retained earnings of £5m.</p><p>Goulding sold its entire holding in Samuelson for a cash consideration of £20m at 31 December 20X3. At the date of disposal, Samuelson had the same share capital but retained earnings were £11m. Goodwill recognised at acquisition has been impaired by 20% during the year ended 31 December 20X2.</p><p>Assuming no accounting entries have been made to date, how should Goulding account for the disposal of its interest in Samuelson in the consolidated accounts?</p><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">a)</span><div><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><tbody><tr><td>£000</td><td class=\"num\">£000</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Dr Bank</td><td class=\"num\">20,000</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Dr SOFP – NCI</td><td class=\"num\">4,000</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Cr Net assets disposed</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">16,000</td></tr><tr><td>Cr SPL – gain on disposal</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">8,000</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">b)</span><div><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><tbody><tr><td>£000</td><td class=\"num\">£000</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Dr Bank</td><td class=\"num\">20,000</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Dr SOFP – NCI</td><td class=\"num\">2,500</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Cr Goodwill</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">2,000</td></tr><tr><td>Cr Net assets disposed</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">16,000</td></tr><tr><td>Cr SPL – gain on disposal</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">4,500</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">c)</span><div><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><tbody><tr><td>£000</td><td class=\"num\">£000</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Dr Bank</td><td class=\"num\">20,000</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Dr SOFP – NCI</td><td class=\"num\">2,500</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Cr Net assets disposed</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">16,000</td></tr><tr><td>Cr SPL – gain on disposal</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">6,500</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">d)</span><div><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><tbody><tr><td>£000</td><td class=\"num\">£000</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Dr Bank</td><td class=\"num\">20,000</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Dr SOFP – NCI</td><td class=\"num\">4,000</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Cr Goodwill</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">2,000</td></tr><tr><td>Cr Net assets disposed</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">16,000</td></tr><tr><td>Cr SPL – gain on disposal</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">6,000</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div>",
    "a": "<p class=\"answer-key\">The correct answer is d.</p><p>Recognise goodwill and non-controlling interests at the date of acquisition</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><tbody><tr><td>£'000</td><td class=\"num\">£'000</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Investment in Samuelson (£10,000,000)</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">10,000</td></tr><tr><td>Non-controlling interests' share of net assets (25%)</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">2,500</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>12,500</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Share capital</td><td class=\"num\">5,000</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Retained earnings</td><td class=\"num\">5,000</td><td class=\"num\">10,000</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Goodwill</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">2,500</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>£'000</td><td class=\"num\">£'000</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>JE1</td><td class=\"num\">Dr</td><td class=\"num\">Share capital</td><td class=\"num\">5,000</td></tr><tr><td>Dr</td><td class=\"num\">Retained earnings</td><td class=\"num\">5,000</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Dr</td><td class=\"num\">Goodwill</td><td class=\"num\">2,500</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Cr</td><td class=\"num\">Investment in Samuelson</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">10,000</td></tr><tr><td>Cr</td><td class=\"num\">SOFP – non-controlling interests</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">5,000</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Being elimination of investment and recognition of goodwill and non-controlling interests</p><p>Note: There is no change in goodwill as it is determined at the date of acquisition.</p><p>Recognise any impairment of goodwill</p><p>Historical impairment = 20% x £2,500,000 = £500,000</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><tbody><tr><td>£'000</td><td class=\"num\">£'000</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>JE2</td><td class=\"num\">Dr</td><td class=\"num\">Retained earnings</td><td class=\"num\">500</td></tr><tr><td>Cr</td><td class=\"num\">Goodwill</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">500</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Being historical impairment of goodwill</p><p>Recognise disposal of subsidiary</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><tbody><tr><td>£'000</td><td class=\"num\">£'000</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Proceeds on disposal</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">20,000</td></tr><tr><td>Net assets of subsidiary at disposal date</td><td class=\"num\">16,000</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>NCI at disposal date (25% x £16,000,000)</td><td class=\"num\">(4,000)</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Goodwill at disposal date</td><td class=\"num\">2,000</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>(14,000)</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"accounting-table rebuilt-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Gain/loss</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">6,000</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>£'000</td><td class=\"num\">£'000</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>JE3</td><td class=\"num\">Dr</td><td class=\"num\">Bank</td><td class=\"num\">20,000</td></tr><tr><td>Dr</td><td class=\"num\">SOFP – NCI</td><td class=\"num\">4,000</td><td class=\"num\"></td></tr><tr><td>Cr</td><td class=\"num\">Goodwill</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">2,000</td></tr><tr><td>Cr</td><td class=\"num\">Net assets disposed</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">16,000</td></tr><tr><td>Cr</td><td class=\"num\">SPL – gain on disposal</td><td class=\"num\"></td><td class=\"num\">6,000</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
